    Parameters
    ----------
    peak_amplitude : float
        Peak of the unit's template, in the data's unit.
    noise_std : float
        Noise σ of the channel, same unit.
    
    Returns
    -------
    float
        `|peak_amplitude| / noise_std`; NaN when the noise is unknown or zero.
